720 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Inspired in the Halo models\054 we are launching our first complete range of exterior accessories\054 CUSTOM CUPRA by ABT\054 which includes a roof spoiler\054 side skirts\054 and front and rear splitters\054 amongst other items to bring the essence of CUPRA Racing not only to the flagship models\054 but also to the rest of the Le\363n and Formentor range\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
