728 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The character of a CUPRA is not only measured by its power\054 but by the attitude it projects from every angle\056 For those seeking an even more technical aesthetic and a commanding visual presence\054 we have designed a range of exterior features that reinforce the brand\031s sporting identity\056 This bespoke equipment package has been designed to accentuate the vehicle\031s key lines\054 providing a sophisticated finish and a darkened look that leaves no doubt as to its high\055performance DNA\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 729 0 R
     /Pg 718 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
