738 0 obj
  << /ActualText (At CUPRA\054 personalization is the ultimate expression of passion\056 For drivers who demand a more aggressive look and an obsessive attention to detail in materials\054 we are introducing this exclusive equipment package\056 A carefully curated selection of aerodynamic features and specific dark\055toned finishes that transform the car\031s silhouette into a bold statement\056 Below\054 we detail the elements that make up this technical and visual evolution\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 739 0 R
     /Pg 718 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
